    <!-- Rods, one per cell in the left pool, as in rods() in floor.scad: a light blue fuel rod in every fuel
         cell and a dark yellow control rod in every control cell (storage cells stay empty).
         Each rod is 0.39 x 0.39 x 1.9 m, centred in its cell, 0.005 m above the cell floor,
         top flush with the cell rim.
